---
type: readme
title: Content capture folder overview
summary: Explains that the folder holds code for capturing already-rendered content, focused on deciding how to capture with respect to timing, quality, and performance.
---

This folder contains code referring to content capture, or the capture of 
"already-rendered stuff." The screen capture implementations (desktop, window,
tab, etc.) in content/ use these tools.  The code in this dir is all about 
deciding how to capture content w.r.t. timing, quality, and other performance
concerns.